    <ul>
      <li>Moisture and particulate methods: USP &lt;731&gt;, &lt;788&gt; — <a href="https://www.usp.org/chemical-medicines" rel="noopener" target="_blank">USP</a>.</li>
      <li>Chinese Pharmacopoeia (ChP 2020) Part IV: chapters 0832, 0903 — cited by chapter number.</li>
      <li>Specification/stability concepts: ICH Q6B — <a href="https://www.ich.org/page/quality-guidelines" rel="noopener" target="_blank">ICH</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="small muted">Laboratory practice guidance; follow your institution's SOPs and the product COA.</p>

    <h2>Limitations</h2>
    <p>This is laboratory practice guidance, not a validated stability study. Follow your institution SOPs and the product COA; individual compounds may behave differently.</p>

